  "ingredients": [
    "1 cup pecan halves",
    "1 teaspoon distilled white vinegar",
    "3 egg whites",
    "1 pinch salt",
    "1 cup white sugar"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Preheat oven to 300 degrees F (150 degrees C).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Place pecans in a resealable plastic baggie. Crush the pecans into small bits. Read John 19:1-3",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Put 1 teaspoon vinegar into a medium bowl. Read John 19:28-30",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Add egg whites to the vinegar. Read John 10:10-11",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Sprinkle salt into the egg whites. Read Luke 23:27",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "So far, the mixture isn't very appetizing. Add 1cup sugar. Read Psalm 34:8 and John 3:16. Beat with mixer on high speed for 12 to 15 minutes until stiff peaks are formed. Read Isaiah 1:18 and John 3:1-3.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Fold in broken nuts. Drop by teaspoons onto parchment paper lined baking sheet. Read Matthew 27:57-60.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Place cookies in the oven close the door and turn the oven off. Read Matthew 27:65-66.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Go to bed. Read John 16:20 and 22.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "In the morning open the oven and take out the cookies. Read Matthew 28:1-9.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    }
  ],
